    "body": "## Second opinion\n\nThe selfhost brief shows the agent ran `pnpm test` once, on src/limits only. I tried to break the change.\n\n### 1. The refill is 1000 times too fast (high)\n\n`elapsed` is in milliseconds and `ratePerSecond` is per second. This test fails on the pull request head:\n\n```ts\nit(\"rejects the 11th request in one second\", () => {\n  const bucket = newBucket({ capacity: 10, ratePerSecond: 10 });\n  for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) expect(take(bucket, 0)).toBe(true);\n  expect(take(bucket, 5)).toBe(false);\n});\n```\n\n### 2. Requests without a key skip the limiter (medium)\n\nRepro: `curl -i https://localhost:3000/v1/items` eleven times in a second; every call answers 200.\n\n<!-- selfhost:second-opinion tool=claude-code-action verdict=changes findings=2 severity=high -->\n"
